  "Hide one block, J K L shuttle, Space to pan, seconds and frames on the ruler, Flipbook cells on the blocks.": "Skrytí jednoho bloku, shuttle J K L, mezerník pro posun, sekundy a snímky na pravítku, buňky Flipbooku na blocích.",
